  "goodToKnow": "Das Postfach is a PO box at the post office, an email inbox (das E-Mail-Postfach) or a pigeonhole at work. Since 2018, German lawyers must use a special electronic mailbox, the beA (besonderes elektronisches Anwaltspostfach). Das Fach means compartment and also school subject: Lieblingsfach. Der Briefkasten is a letterbox. Plural: die Postfächer."
